<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flaccĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		flaccus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>flabby</i>, <i>flaccid</i>, <i>pendulous</i> (cf. marcidus). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aures,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 6, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 51, 77, § 205</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					15, 30, 39, § 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vela (with pendula),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Flor. p. 365</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>languid</i>, <i>feeble</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flaccidiore turbine fertur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 632</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argumentatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 7, 251</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
